{"mangaRefs":["file-882-884"],"locationRefs":[],"summary":{"ja":"黒ずくめの組織の薬で“江戸川コナン”になる少し前――。交際前の新一と蘭は、別居中の蘭の両親を仲直りさせる「水族館ドッキリ再会ラブラブ復活大作戦」の下見で、米花水族館を訪れていた。しかし、楽しい時間もつかの間、新一は人だかりの先に漂う異様な空気に事件を察知する。血の匂いを嗅ぎつけて現場へ赴き、持てる感覚のすべてを使って犯人を割り出す、緋色の高校生探偵の推理劇が始まる！　そして、事件の先には、あの日へとつながる“もうひとつの下見”が……！？","en":"","zhHans":"","zhHant":"","sourcePage":"src-yomiuri-tv-conan","sourceQuote":true},"characters":["character-ran-mouri","character-kogoro-mouri","character-conan-edogawa","character-shinichi-kudo","character-juzo-megure","character-kaito-kid","character-eri-kisaki"],"organizations":[],"locations":[],"gadgets":[],"caseTypes":[],"sources":["src-abiting-conan-database","src-detective-conan-world-anime"],"detailStatus":"reviewed","coverage":{"directory":true,"basicFacts":true,"structure":true,"deepSpoilers":true},"raw":{"manga":"Vol. 0","specialLabel":null,"rawIndex":1186,"dcwMangaSource":"V83 - F10 ~ V84 - F2V1 (Special Edition) - F0(882-884, 000)","dcwMangaKind":"manga","dcwAirDate":"January 3, 2026"},"season":31,"solvedByRaw":"Shinichi Kudo","solvedBy":"character-shinichi-kudo","castNames":["Shinichi Kudo","Ran Mouri","Juzo Megure","Conan Edogawa","Kaito Kuroba","Aoko Nakamori","Kogoro Mouri","Eri Kisaki"],"dcwL3Source":{"season":"Episode_\"ZERO\"_The_Shinichi_Kudo_Aquarium_Case"}}